{"detail": {"templateUuid": "fa7972764c9941c09ad99fa67e13bd43", "projectUuid": "ad22d650ad6946d3adf5d20f53af8b58", "name": "带来光明之人-路西法", "description": "在天地尚未命名的远古，光还没有被白昼与黑夜切分。有一位天使，他的名字叫路西法 —— 意思是 \"带来光明的人\"。\n\n他是所有天使中最耀眼的那一个。羽翼如熔金，声音能让星辰共鸣。他站在天堂最高的第七层，离神的宝座只有一步之遥。神爱他，将最炽烈的光放进他的胸膛，让他做黎明的使者，做群星的统领。\n\n众生仰望他，称他为 \"晨星\"……", "coverUrl": "/assets/0be209d76b8dfd95.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/c124bbc3b9ff4c60b4311c1b77d90a0f/3ff9ec1e07cc9dc50540546a78fd40d058b2a1c3.mp4", "snapshotId": 26545, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 797672, "ownerUuid": "c124bbc3b9ff4c60b4311c1b77d90a0f", "avatar": "/assets/0797f12f44fbf4f3.webp", "nickname": "牛斗", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 831, "tags": [{"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5003, "name": "荣誉", "icon": "/assets/9b8f94fcb073c296.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/deb1579e9091de84.webp", "desc": "LibTV荣誉作者", "verifyLevel": 3}], "score": 0, "createAt": "2026年07月13日 13:49", "updateAt": "2026年07月20日 23:29", "publishAt": "2026年07月13日 13:49", "playCount": 1117, "viewCreationProcessCount": 561, "copyCanvasCount": 115, "shareCount": 9, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/fa7972764c9941c09ad99fa67e13bd43.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 150, "edges": 83}}, "recommendList": []}